		plain: "A raw timestamp mostly orders rows by what came later. If you want weekday, hour or month, you must split them out.",
		situation: "If you leave the date column as is, the line reads it as \"the later, the more forms\". Sunday and Monday are not two steps of that straight line. Split out weekday, hour and month if that is the question you ask.",
