		precise: "The session \"S4 Practice Questions (Optional)\" belongs to course Introduction to GenAI and Working with OpenAI APIs. This session must not be written as questions or click-by-click steps in the notebook. When you need to do the exercise, reopen the teaching cards of the same course to get the definitions. The notebook holds no answers to practice.",
		insight: "Practice only applies ideas already learned; it is not a new idea.",
