		precise: "The session \"S3 Graded Questions\" belongs to course Retrieval Augmented Generation with LlamaIndex. This session must not be written as questions or click-by-click steps in the notebook. When you need to do the exercise, reopen the teaching cards of the same course to get the definitions. The notebook holds no answers to practice.",
