		precise: "The four cells are TP (true positive, a correct call to a leaver), FP (false positive, a wrong call), FN (false negative, a leaver missed) and TN (true negative, a stayer correctly left alone). Accuracy = (TP + TN) / N. Plugging in: (30 + 140) / 200 = 170 / 200 = 0.85. Common mix-up: if only 8% of customers leave and you call nobody, accuracy is 92% but you catch no one.",
		insight: "Accuracy can be high while you miss exactly the people you needed to call.",
