		precise: "Precision = TP / (TP + FP) = 30 / 40 = 0.75. Recall = TP / (TP + FN) = 30 / 50 = 0.60. Recall is also called sensitivity. Specificity = TN / (TN + FP) = 140 / 150 ≈ 0.93, the share of stayers correctly left alone. Common mix-up: no threshold wins on all three metrics, and lowering the threshold usually raises recall and lowers precision.",
