		prior: "Bag-of-words counts words. But common words still look as if they score high.",
		see: "This picture shows TF-IDF. The word \"spa\" scores low because it is everywhere. The word \"wait\" still scores high because it is rare.",
		plain: "TF-IDF keeps the number of times a word appears in a document and shrinks words that appear in many documents.",
